  "summary": "关联理论由斯珀伯与威尔逊于1986年提出，从认知角度解释交际与话语理解。它主张交际是明示—推理过程，听话人依据认知语境寻求最佳关联，即以最小加工努力获得足够的语境效果。该理论把格莱斯合作原则的多条准则压缩为一条关联原则，并提出明说与隐含、概念意义与程序意义等区分，广泛用于翻译、文学与词汇语用学研究，也受到关联可否证伪等批评。",
  "summaryEn": "Relevance theory, proposed by Dan Sperber and Deirdre Wilson in 1986, explains communication and utterance interpretation from a cognitive perspective. It treats communication as an ostensive-inferential process in which the hearer seeks optimal relevance: adequate contextual effects for the least processing effort. The theory reduces Grice's maxims to a single principle of relevance and introduces distinctions such as explicature versus implicature and conceptual versus procedural meaning. It has been widely applied in translation, literature and lexical pragmatics, and criticised for the testability of relevance itself.",
  "sections": [
   {
    "h": "理论背景与基本主张",
    "hEn": "Background and Central Claim",
    "p": [
     "关联理论诞生于对格莱斯会话含义理论的修正。格莱斯提出合作原则及若干准则，却没有说明听话人如何在众多可能的含义中作出选择，也没有解释为什么某些含义更容易想到。斯珀伯与威尔逊认为，人类认知以追求关联为基本倾向，交际因此可以被纳入认知效率的框架。他们区分认知关联原则与交际关联原则：前者指人类认知倾向于追求最大关联，后者指每一次明示交际都传递自身具有最佳关联的假定，听话人据此确定说话人的意图。"
    ],
    "pEn": [
     "Relevance theory emerged as a revision of Grice's account of conversational implicature. Grice proposed a cooperative principle with several maxims, but he did not explain how hearers select among the many implicatures an utterance might carry, nor why some interpretations come to mind more readily than others. Sperber and Wilson argue that human cognition is geared towards relevance, so communication can be modelled in terms of cognitive efficiency. They distinguish a cognitive principle of relevance, according to which cognition tends to maximise relevance, from a communicative principle, according to which every act of ostensive communication conveys a presumption of its own optimal relevance, on which the hearer relies in identifying the speaker's intention."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "核心概念",
    "hEn": "Core Concepts",
    "p": [
     "关联由两个因素决定：语境效果与加工努力。语境效果指新信息在听话人认知语境中引起的修正、加强或削弱；加工努力指理解话语所需的心理投入。在其他条件相同的情况下，语境效果越大、努力越小，关联性越强。最佳关联并不等于最大关联，而是说话人在自身能力与偏好范围内能够产生、且值得听话人付出努力去加工的那一关联程度。此外，明说指话语显性表达并经充实后的命题，隐含则是需要推理才能获得的假设。"
    ],
    "pEn": [
     "Relevance is determined by two factors: contextual effects and processing effort. Contextual effects are the revisions, strengthenings or weakenings that new information brings about in the hearer's cognitive context; processing effort is the mental cost of interpreting an utterance. Other things being equal, relevance increases with greater contextual effects and decreases with greater effort. Optimal relevance is not maximal relevance: it is the degree of relevance that the speaker is willing and able to achieve and that is worth the hearer's processing effort. The theory also distinguishes explicature, the explicitly communicated and enriched proposition, from implicature, an inferred assumption."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "示例与分析",
    "hEn": "Examples and Analysis",
    "p": [
     "设有人问 Did you enjoy the party?，回答是 Some of it was fun。听话人须先把 some 的指称范围充实为具体的一部分，再结合语境推出隐含：整场聚会并不都令人愉快。汉语中「他是昨天来的」把时间成分标为焦点，明说层面表达到访时间，隐含层面可能带有纠正意味。词汇语用学还研究 kill、red 等词在语境中被临时收窄或放宽的用法，而 but、even、so 只编码程序意义，指引听话人加工相邻命题。"
    ],
    "pEn": [
     "Consider an exchange in which one speaker asks Did you enjoy the party? and the other replies Some of it was fun. The hearer must enrich the quantifier to a specific range and then combine the utterance with context to derive the implicature that not all of the party was enjoyable. In Mandarin, 他是昨天来的 marks the time expression as focus: the explicature states when he came, while the implicature may carry a contrastive or corrective nuance. Lexical pragmatics studies how words such as kill or red are narrowed or broadened in context, showing that concepts are adjusted online, whereas items such as but, even and so encode procedural meaning and guide the processing of neighbouring propositions rather than naming a concept."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "影响、应用与批评",
    "hEn": "Influence, Applications and Criticism",
    "p": [
     "关联理论深刻影响了语用学、翻译研究、文学文体学与二语教学。翻译研究用关联原则解释译者如何在原语说话人的意图与目标语读者的期待之间取舍，词汇语用学则借助它解释词义的在线调整。批评主要集中在三点：关联原则近乎不可证伪；以认知效率解释一切交际有循环论证之嫌；对社会文化因素与礼貌现象的处理不如布朗与列文森的礼貌理论细致。尽管如此，该理论仍是后格莱斯语用学的核心框架之一，并持续引发实验语用学的检验。"
    ],
    "pEn": [
     "Relevance theory has strongly influenced pragmatics, translation studies, literary stylistics and second language teaching. Translation scholars use the principle of relevance to model the translator's choices between the source speaker's intentions and target readers' expectations, and lexical pragmatics appeals to it in explaining online meaning adjustment. Criticism centres on three points: the principle of relevance is hard to falsify; explaining all communication by cognitive efficiency risks circularity; and the framework handles socio-cultural factors and politeness less fully than Brown and Levinson's theory. It nevertheless remains a central post-Gricean framework and continues to generate work in experimental pragmatics."
    ]
   }
  ],
