   {
    "h": "形态与结构特征",
    "hEn": "Morphological and Structural Features",
    "p": [
     "亚非语系最具标志性的特征是词根与模式形态，即三辅音词根插入不同的元音模式构成整个词族。阿拉伯语词根 k-t-b 可派生 kataba（他写了）、kitāb（书）、kātib（作家）与 maktūb（被写的）。闪米特语还用不连续语素构成所谓破碎复数，如 kitāb 的复数 kutub。音系上普遍存在咽化的强调辅音，如阿拉伯语 sˤ、dˤ、tˤ、ðˤ。句法上闪米特语与柏柏尔语常用动词居首的语序，名词区分阳性与阴性，并有三格系统。"
    ],
    "pEn": [
     "The hallmark of Afroasiatic is root-and-pattern, or templatic, morphology. A triconsonantal root is interleaved with vocalic patterns to build word families: Arabic k-t-b gives kataba 'he wrote', kitāb 'book', kātib 'writer' and maktūb 'written'. Semitic also forms plurals with discontinuous morphemes, as in Arabic kitāb 'book' with the broken plural kutub. Pharyngealized or glottalized emphatic consonants are widespread, for example Arabic sˤ, dˤ, tˤ and ðˤ. Syntactically, Semitic and Berber typically place the verb first, and nouns distinguish masculine from feminine and mark nominative, genitive and accusative case."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "历史与谱系研究",
    "hEn": "History and Genealogical Research",
    "p": [
     "亚非语系诸语的历史比较研究始于十九世纪，但现代分类的奠基者是格林伯格，他在《非洲的语言》中依据词汇与形态证据取消含米特语族，把其成员分归柏柏尔、库施、乍得与奥莫。闪米特语的内部分类较为可靠，因为有阿卡德语、吉兹语与阿拉伯语的大量文献与碑铭支持。原始亚非语的构拟存在多种方案，如 Orel 与 Stolbova 的辅音对应体系以及 Ehret 的重建，彼此差异较大。祖语故乡有东北非与阿拉伯半岛两说，近年证据多倾向东北非。"
    ],
    "pEn": [
     "Comparative work on Afroasiatic began in the nineteenth century, but the modern classification was established by Joseph Greenberg, who in The Languages of Africa abandoned the Hamitic hypothesis and redistributed its members among Berber, Cushitic, Chadic and Omotic. The internal classification of Semitic is comparatively secure, supported by a rich record of Akkadian, Ge'ez and Arabic texts. Reconstructions of Proto-Afroasiatic differ considerably, as in the competing proposals of Orel and Stolbova and of Ehret. Its homeland is disputed between Northeast Africa and Arabia, and recent linguistic and genetic evidence tends to favour Africa."
    ]
   }
